slua provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-slua CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::slua::Luau.Analysis unofficial::slua::Luau.Compiler)

Headers are under include/slua and are included as Luau/<Name>.h. The compiler
links tailslide, whose package the config finds; Luau/LSLCompiler.h compiles LSL
for Luau's VM.
